.TH tuseq 1 0.29.0 tclutils "Tcl Utility Command"
.SH NAME
tuseq \- thin CLI wrapper for tclutils::tuseq
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
tuseq ?-format F? ?-separator S? ?-equalwidth 0|1? last | first last | first incr last
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The tuseq command is a thin wrapper around the Tcl package tclutils::tuseq. It is intended for interactive and scripting use when tclutils is installed from source. The primary API remains the Tcl library; see tuseq(n) for procedures, options, and semantics.
.PP
Run the script with tclsh:
.PP
.nf
tclsh bin/tuseq.tcl ...
.fi
